s it's not the primary key it could be anything. The important part is the `joinWith` being non eagerly loaded and running it `asArray` and attempting to group by.\n\nSo for example:\n\n```\nStudent::find()\n->select(['student.instructor', 'AVG(studentScore.scores) AS averageScore'])\n->joinWith('studentScores', false)\n->groupBy(['student.instructor'])\n->asArray()\n->all()\n```\n\nI would exect the results to look something like this:\n\n```\n[\n    [ 'instructor' => 'Jim', 'averageScore' => 88],\n    [ 'instructor' => 'Jane', 'averageScore' => 92],\n    [ 'instructor' => 'Bob', 'averageScore' => 85],\n]\n```\n\nCurrently though (assuming that instructor isn't the primary key on the student table) the populate function tries to run, and it can't find the primary key, even though in this case there is no need to have it because the join happens on the database side of things and not in yii because I set joinWith eager loading to false.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/111655740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"joe-meyer","id":1292766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI3NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1292766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer","html_url":"https://github.com/joe-meyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-meyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.gith